    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It is a grass Gu and a recon or investigative Gu. No cultivation path is named for it in the cited chapters.",
        "chapters": [
          128
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "path",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
  "appearance": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "It resembles a human ear, but much smaller. It is yellowish-brown, shrivelled and dull when first taken from the Earth Treasury Flower. In the palm it feels shrivelled like marinated radish and carries some warmth. Dozens of roots like ginseng roots grow out from its sides. After feeding restores its vitality, it is plump and warm, fat and big up to an adult palm size, highly elastic, and resembles the Buddha’s drooping ear of Earth.",
        "chapters": [
          128
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "appearance",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It remains rank two while its range is much greater than most rank three Gu worms.",
        "chapters": [
          210
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_gu_worms"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan also knows it as Earth Communication Flesh Ear Gu when he weighs the price of use.",
        "chapters": [
          128
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "form-and-rank",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ],
    "visual_confidence": "text_described"
  },
  "abilities": {
    "activation_raw": null,
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan uses it to scout up to three hundred paces, a reach that can compare with many rank three investigative Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          128
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "sys_investigative_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He later places it as recon among six attributes for travel support: attack, defense, healing, storage, recon, and movement.",
        "chapters": [
          157
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Without roots in the ground, hearing improves but the Gu stays at a very average rank two recon level. Once the roots enter the ground or rock, range jumps; with him as center he can hear a three hundred step radius.",
        "chapters": [
          129
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It is most sensitive to footsteps and other noise, but it cannot tell male from female, and Silent Step Gu can hide footsteps from it.",
        "chapters": [
          138
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It does not increase vision.",
        "chapters": [
          167
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "A still sleeper makes no movement for it to hear; once that person moves, the Gu can catch them.",
        "chapters": [
          133
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Activating it costs continuous primeval essence. Gu worms can be lent, so more than one person can take turns using it.",
        "chapters": [
          210
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "effect",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Refining alone is not enough. To use it, Fang Yuan cuts off his right ear and presses the Gu onto the wound so its roots take hold and the Gu becomes his new ear.",
        "chapters": [
          128
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "cost-to-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "The body then needs time to adapt; overnight the swollen ear settles to a normal look.",
        "chapters": [
          129
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "cost-to-use",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan uses it to listen through the rock door and walls of the centipede cave, identify the Chainsaw Golden Centipede, and judge that the inheritance means him to avoid that threat with this Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          129
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_chainsaw_golden_centipede"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Before looting wolf corpses he uses the three hundred step hearing to confirm no nearby packs; later the same range lets him infer at least a three hundred step gap to the true wolf tide.",
        "chapters": [
          130
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In smoke that blocks sight, the Gu still hears, and paired with Bai Ning Bing’s Lightning Eye Gu the two avoid strong packs while escaping. The Ear Grass reaches about two hundred steps there, and Fang Yuan squats to push its roots into the soil for a clearer read.",
        "chapters": [
          169
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "early-use-on-qing-mao-mountain",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_ning_bing",
          "gu_lightning_eye_gu"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "feeding": {
    "known": true,
    "food_raw": null,
    "foods": [],
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Its food is ginseng roots. Fang Yuan recovers its vitality with ginseng bought for small battle merits. The Gu is easy to nurture, while using it is rather troublesome.",
        "chapters": [
          128
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "feeding",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
