  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan finds it on Qing Mao Mountain in a stone crack cave, inside an Earth Treasury Flower before a stone door that warns of a Golden Centipede danger and points to Earth Communication as the way to avoid it. The flower sits where the soil runs wet enough to dig, and he refines the Gu at once without opening the stone door itself.",
        "chapters": [
          128
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "loc_qing_mao_mountain",
          "gu_earth_treasury_flower_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "While judging that cave, he names the inheritance as the Flower Wine Monk’s and reads its intent as forcing use of this Gu to avoid the centipede.",
        "chapters": [
          129
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_flower_wine_monk"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Once planted as Fang Yuan’s right ear, after his body adapts the ear looks ordinary again. When he feeds red steel primeval essence into it, roots like those of a thousand year ginseng grow from the ear toward the ground, and the ear tends to fatten; stopping the Gu retracts the roots and returns the ear to normal.",
        "chapters": [
          129
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "planted-as-ear",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "It has turned into one of Fang Yuan’s ears and would not normally show up.",
        "chapters": [
          202
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "planted-as-ear",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "In rank five immortal-snake fog that suppresses Lightning Eye Gu, Fang Yuan still hears within about three hundred steps, navigates by sound, and tries to leave the battlefield with this Gu alone.",
        "chapters": [
          190
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fog-and-later-scouting",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "While still rank two and long-ranged, he and Bai Ning Bing plan to take turns using the Gu to watch a cave.",
        "chapters": [
          210
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "fog-and-later-scouting",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Ginseng roots stored in a tusita flower are enough to support Earth Communication Ear grass for a year. Fang Yuan counts it among his aperture Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          202
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "stored-ginseng",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "res_ginseng_roots"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "When Bai Ning Bing moves to cut her own right ear for the Gu, Fang Yuan stops her because Chen Cui Hua has already left the cave; he uses Earth Communication Ear grass himself and trails Chen Cui Hua from a distance until the two of them hear the twin-headed boar fight.",
        "chapters": [
          211
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "trailing-chen-cui-hua",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chen_cui_hua"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During the escape from the footless bird, Bai Zhan Wen’s self-detonation sets Fang Yuan on fire, and the wind feeds the flames until the Gu, still seated as his right ear, is burnt.",
        "chapters": [
          227
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "destroyed-by-fire",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_bai_zhan_wen"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "The Gu is destroyed and Fang Yuan’s right ear is shattered; Meat Bone Gu cannot heal that cartilage injury, and he decides to keep one ear less rather than replace it. He lists Earth Communication Ear Grass with Chainsaw Golden Centipede, Carapace Gu, Iron Thistles, Stealth Scales Gu and Footless Bird among pursuit losses, calls the loss troublesome, and judges it leaves a hole in their investigative reach.",
        "chapters": [
          228
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "destroyed-by-fire",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_meat_bone_gu",
          "gu_carapace_gu",
          "gu_stealth_scales_gu",
          "gu_footless_bird_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan no longer has the Gu to scout with, but he and his companions rely on two Breath Concealment Gu instead to avoid dangers around Zi You mountain.",
        "chapters": [
          229
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "scouting-without-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_breath_concealment_gu",
          "loc_zi_you_mountain"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "He notes that losing it leaves them without investigative Gu, which makes traveling alone troublesome and is one reason he wants to join a caravan.",
        "chapters": [
          232
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "scouting-without-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Without it and with no other scouting method, he overlooks Chen Xin and does not know how much Chen Xin has learned.",
        "chapters": [
          253
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "scouting-without-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_chen_xin"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "With no other investigative method again, he has to rely on speculation.",
        "chapters": [
          255
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "scouting-without-it",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
